7️⃣ Backward Compatibility Rules (VERY IMPORTANT)
✅ Additive Changes (SAFE)

✔ Add new fields
✔ Add optional params

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 1000,
  "currency": "INR"  // NEW FIELD
}
❌ Breaking Changes (AVOID)

❌ Remove fields
❌ Rename fields
❌ Change data types

8️⃣ API Evolution Strategy
v1 → Stable
v2 → New features
v1 → Deprecated (after some time)
